              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwekhumi nalulala, mumwesi kwambeli, nikuli musaafu, likhuwa liOMWAMI nilinzitsila, liri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana womundu, ndafunaache omukhono kwaFarao omuruchi waMisiri; kata lola, shikuboyilwe kata okhusilikhwa kata okhubohwakhwo ipendechi mbu kube okwamaani okhutiila olukanga, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, kano niko aka Omwami NYASAYE aboola; mbu Lola, efukula Farao omuruchi waMisiri; ndalafunaka amakhonoke, mbu okwo okuli kwamaani, nende okwo okwafinikha; ndalachila olukanga nilulakakha okhurula mumukhonokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalasalaasia abaMisiri mumahanga nimbakabula mubialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakufuhasia amakhono komuruchi waBabeli, nimutiisia olukanga lwanje mumukhonokwe; nebutswa ndalafunaka amakhono kaFarao, naye alabinda imbeliwe, okhubinda khwomundu oufumirwa niyeenya okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakufuhasia amakhono komuruchi waBabeli, ne amakhono kaFarao kalatubukha; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI, olwa ndalatiisia olukanga lwanje mumukhono kwomuruchi waBabeli, naye nalunyiila khushialo shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalasalaasia abaMisiri mumahanga, nimbakabula mubialo; mana balamanya mbu isie nisie OMWAMI.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
